   "height": 30.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "改善点",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "改善点",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 10786,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 47716,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1539",
   "x": 1715.0,
   "y": 1522.0,
   "width": 403.6,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "1. シングルトンが13個。実体を持っているのは3つだけ",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. シングルトンが13個。実体を持っているのは3つだけ",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 10793,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 47747,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1540",
   "x": 1715.0,
   "y": 1542.0,
   "width": 546.4,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    MainEngine / SceneManager / GameManager 以外の10個は\n    「どこからでも引ける置き場」になっていて、依存の向きが追えない。\n    MainEngine が起動時に組み立てて配れば緑矢印はかなり減らせる。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    MainEngine / SceneManager / GameManager 以外の10個は\n    「どこからでも引ける置き場」になっていて、依存の向きが追えない。\n    MainEngine が起動時に組み立てて配れば緑矢印はかなり減らせる。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 10800,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 47778,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1541",
   "x": 1715.0,
   "y": 1622.0,
   "width": 249.8,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "2. 相互に引き合っている組がある",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "2. 相互に引き合っている組がある",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 10807,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 47809,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1542",
   "x": 1715.0,
   "y": 1642.0,
   "width": 516.0000000000006,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    D3D12Wrapper ⇄ DescriptorHeapManager\n    OptionManager ⇄ MainEngine / InputManager / AudioManager\n    初期化順と解放順が暗黙の了解になっている。片方向に倒したい。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    D3D12Wrapper ⇄ DescriptorHeapManager\n    OptionManager ⇄ MainEngine / InputManager / AudioManager\n    初期化順と解放順が暗黙の了解になっている。片方向に倒したい。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 10814,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 47840,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1543",
   "x": 1715.0,
   "y": 1722.0,
   "width": 392.4,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "3. BaseScene が9個のシングルトンを直接引いている",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "3. BaseScene が9個のシングルトンを直接引いている",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 10821,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 47871,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1544",
   "x": 1715.0,
   "y": 1742.0,
   "width": 514.0000000000002,
   "height": 60.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    EngineServices を組み立てているのは BaseScene 自身なので、\n    作ったあとは自分もそこ経由で引けば直引きを消せる。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    EngineServices を組み立てているのは BaseScene 自身なので、\n    作ったあとは自分もそこ経由で引けば直引きを消せる。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
